tell application "System Events" to tell process "Dia"
set e to text field "Please describe your project in 100 words or more. Required question" of group 1 of group 1 of group 1 of group 2 of group 5 of list 1 of group 1 of UI element 1 of scroll area 1 of front window
set value of e to "Gaia is a self-initiated reimagining of iNaturalist that grew out of my interest in the outdoors and the people who share what they find there. I wanted to make contributing to biodiversity science feel approachable to someone who is curious about nature but would never call themselves a naturalist. I renamed the platform and designed its identity, then carried that system into a working iOS prototype. A branching mark, colors drawn from the natural world, and botanical illustrations establish the visual language. The interface puts a map at the center of discovery and guides people toward making an observation. Each find connects a personal moment outdoors to a shared record of living things. I worked alone from strategy through implementation, building core interactions in SwiftUI. The proposal also includes print, outdoor, and community-event applications, showing how the same invitation could reach people beyond the app."
return value of e
end tell